        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
            "name2": "avg_npc_037",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Sup? Where's FrostNova?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Your commander fell down there too, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
            "name2": "avg_npc_037",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "...Yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "Could we not fight?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "Rabbit of Rhodes Island, could we forge a temporary armistice? Honestly, we never much wanted to fight you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "But..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "Mephisto told our sister you'd killed Alex, and she was very concerned about what you would do next."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "...Who's Alex?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "Skullshatterer."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I'm sorry. I did kill Skullshatterer."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "...Oh."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Infected really should not fight one another. I'm sorry."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "What's to apologize for? It was a battle, wasn't it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "It was."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "So let's have a ceasefire. Nesti, what do you say?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "Huh? *Ursine profanity*!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "Nesti says he's fine with it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf",
        "text": "I don't think that's what he said."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "As long as we're not in battle, there's no reason to kill anyone, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Why is it... you want a ceasefire?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "Did you ever notice that both our sides are led by rabbits?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "...Huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_193_frostl_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf",
        "text": "I think something in my brain just broke."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_193_frostl_1#5",
            "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jessica",
        "text": "Hm?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
            "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf",
        "text": "These are the yetis of the ice field?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
            "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jessica",
        "text": "Wh- what do you mean?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
            "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf",
        "text": "Shouldn't they be cold, merciless killers?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf",
        "text": "This isn't right."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "That's prejudiced."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "Listen here, bunny."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "Who wins the battle, or where you go, none of that matters to us. All we care about is our sister's life."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "And you're worried about your friend too, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "...Right. We didn't come here to hurt anyone."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "You're definitely not here to hunt Reunion for sport, are you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Of course not!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "You know... it's funny..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "If it weren't for Patriot insisting on unity in the Reunion Movement, we'd have dealt with Mephisto and his people a long time ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "And that'd be kinda like hunting Reunion for sport, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Huh..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_037",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member",
        "text": "Let's get digging, shall we?"
    },
